This is DoodleStories — a children's AI storytelling app.
Tech stack: React (Create React App), Vercel serverless functions,
Anthropic Claude API for story generation, Vercel KV, Google Cloud TTS
(Gemini Pro, Achernar voice). Live at doodlestories.app.
GitHub: doodlestoriesapp/doodle-stories

Goal: Migrate from CRA to Expo for iOS and Android app store launch.
- Keep all Vercel API routes unchanged (backend stays on Vercel)
- Replace Canvas API with expo-image-manipulator or expo-sharing
- Replace localStorage with AsyncStorage
- Target bundle ID: app.doodlestories
- Age rating: 4+ (children's app, COPPA compliant)
- Preferred style: complete file replacements, not surgical diffs
